  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With a list of 24-hour clock time points in **\"HH:MM\"** format, output *the smallest **minutes** difference between any two time-points in the list*.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: timePoints = [\"23:59\",\"00:00\"]\nOutput: 1\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: timePoints = [\"00:00\",\"23:59\",\"00:00\"]\nOutput: 0\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `2 <= timePoints.length <= 2 * 104`\n* `timePoints[i]` is in the format **\"HH:MM\"**.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
